==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Araquanid|33}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*'''Dangerous Claws''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Lycanroc|75}} from {{TCG|Burning Shadows}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

